{"id":"2JN","name":"2 John","chapters":[{"number":1,"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The elder, To the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in the truth — and not I alone, but also all who know the truth —","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":14,"end":17,"marker":"add"},{"start":63,"end":66,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":2,"text":"because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever:","notes":[],"characterSpans":[]},{"number":3,"text":"Grace, mercy, and peace from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":14,"end":17,"marker":"add"},{"start":33,"end":36,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":4,"text":"I was overjoyed to find some of your children walking in the truth, just as the Father has commanded us.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":24,"end":28,"marker":"add"},{"start":57,"end":60,"marker":"add"},{"start":101,"end":103,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":5,"text":"And now I urge you, dear lady — not as a new commandment to you, but one we have had from the beginning — that we love one another.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":20,"end":24,"marker":"add"},{"start":69,"end":72,"marker":"add"},{"start":90,"end":93,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":6,"text":"And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from the beginning, that you must walk in love.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":111,"end":114,"marker":"add"},{"start":148,"end":152,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":7,"text":"For many deceivers have gone out into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh. Any such person  is the deceiver and the antichrist.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":99,"end":102,"marker":"add"},{"start":119,"end":126,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":8,"text":"Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for, but that you may be fully rewarded.","notes":[{"at":66,"marker":"f","caller":"+","text":"1:8 NE and WH what you have worked for","content":[{"type":"char","marker":"fr","content":["1:8 "]},{"type":"char","marker":"ft","content":["NE and WH "]},{"type":"char","marker":"fqa","content":["what you have worked for"]}]}],"characterSpans":[{"start":71,"end":75,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":9,"text":"Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in His teaching has both the Father and the Son.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":104,"end":107,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":10,"text":"If anyone comes to you but does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your home or even greet him.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":23,"end":26,"marker":"add"},{"start":57,"end":59,"marker":"add"},{"start":81,"end":85,"marker":"add"},{"start":91,"end":93,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":11,"text":"Whoever greets such a person shares in his evil deeds.","notes":[],"characterSpans":[{"start":15,"end":28,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":12,"text":"I have many things to write to you, but I would prefer not to do so with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you face to face, so that our joy may be complete.","notes":[{"at":144,"marker":"f","caller":"+","text":"1:12 Literally mouth to mouth","content":[{"type":"char","marker":"fr","content":["1:12 "]},{"type":"char","marker":"ft","content":["Literally "]},{"type":"char","marker":"fqa","content":["mouth to mouth"]}]}],"characterSpans":[{"start":36,"end":39,"marker":"add"},{"start":59,"end":67,"marker":"add"},{"start":131,"end":135,"marker":"add"},{"start":139,"end":143,"marker":"add"}]},{"number":13,"text":"The children of your elect sister send you greetings.","notes":[{"at":53,"marker":"f","caller":"+","text":"1:13 BYZ and TR include Amen.","content":[{"type":"char","marker":"fr","content":["1:13 "]},{"type":"char","marker":"ft","content":["BYZ and TR include "]},{"type":"char","marker":"fqa","content":["Amen."]}]}],"characterSpans":[]}],"headings":[{"afterVerse":null,"style":"s1","text":"A Greeting from the Elder","content":["A Greeting from the Elder"]},{"afterVerse":null,"style":"r","text":"(3 John 1:1–4)","content":["(",{"type":"ref","loc":"3JN 1-4","content":["3 John 1:1–4"]},")"]},{"afterVerse":3,"style":"s1","text":"Walking in the Truth","content":["Walking in the Truth"]},{"afterVerse":3,"style":"r","text":"(John 8:30–47)","content":["(",{"type":"ref","loc":"JHN 8:30-47","content":["John 8:30–47"]},")"]},{"afterVerse":6,"style":"s1","text":"Beware of Deceivers","content":["Beware of Deceivers"]},{"afterVerse":11,"style":"s1","text":"Conclusion","content":["Conclusion"]},{"afterVerse":11,"style":"r","text":"(3 John 1:13–14)","content":["(",{"type":"ref","loc":"3JN 13-14","content":["3 John 1:13–14"]},")"]}],"paragraphs":[{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":1,"start":0,"end":10}]},{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":1,"start":11,"end":125},{"verse":2,"start":0,"end":67}]},{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":2,"start":67,"end":67},{"verse":3,"start":0,"end":124}]},{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":3,"start":124,"end":124},{"verse":4,"start":0,"end":104},{"verse":5,"start":0,"end":131},{"verse":6,"start":0,"end":153}]},{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":6,"start":153,"end":153},{"verse":7,"start":0,"end":162},{"verse":8,"start":0,"end":102},{"verse":9,"start":0,"end":149}]},{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":9,"start":149,"end":149},{"verse":10,"start":0,"end":109},{"verse":11,"start":0,"end":54}]},{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":11,"start":54,"end":54},{"verse":12,"start":0,"end":177}]},{"style":"p","spans":[{"verse":12,"start":177,"end":177},{"verse":13,"start":0,"end":53}]}],"offsetUnit":"unicode-codepoint"}],"frontMatter":[{"style":"h","text":"2 John","content":["2 John"]},{"style":"toc1","text":"2 John","content":["2 John"]},{"style":"toc2","text":"2 John","content":["2 John"]},{"style":"toc3","text":"2JN","content":["2JN"]},{"style":"mt1","text":"2 John","content":["2 John"]}]}
